### Blinking LED

This example demonstrates how to blink an LED connected to pin PB0 on an ATmega328P microcontroller.

```c
#include <avr/io.h>
#include <util/delay.h>

int main() {
    // Set PB0 as output
    DDRB |= (1 << DDB0);

    while (1) {
        // Turn on the LED
        PORTB |= (1 << PB0);
        _delay_ms(1000);

        // Turn off the LED
        PORTB &= ~(1 << PB0);
        _delay_ms(1000);
    }

    return 0;
}
```

